{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is yours to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are your toys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violence is your religion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a <u>multitude</u> of custom-coded SuperVillains. All inspired by your favorite superheroes, all with unique abilities and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absolutely <u>dominate</u>\u00a0the city of Godvale, killing anything and everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Supervillain has their own unique set of godlike powers: from 'Laser Vision' to Dark Magick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation, Nanoblades, Mechsuit Technology, and nearly a dozen more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the god of your choice, you will take over this world and torment its population as you see fit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, <u>you</u> are the only one in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*************************************************************************</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in Procedural Dismemberment algorithm allows you laser ANY npc to pieces, in an ultra-realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear them scream, watch them die with their lasered-off limbs strewn about. They do not stand a chance against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Evil Superhero Simulator' is a huge passion project of mine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am currently in game development school, and coding the mechanics in this Superhero game have been invaluable. I have wanted to release an epic Superhero simulator for years!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy! More content is being coded right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863710?t=1754866523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/6bda96d5da29e4018ad5ce9cd36406609365786c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754866523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/d0fcbfef90811419d83ff9817675fbe99f9a7dc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754866523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/d0fcbfef90811419d83ff9817675fbe99f9a7dc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754866523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You will play as an Evil Superhero who can use his laser eyes and super strength to cut civilians up, and smash them into the sky. The game technically does show 'criminal behavior' in a favorable light, although I do not condone using laser vision to hurt people in real life."},"demos":[{"appid":3915100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a god.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is yours to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People are your toys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Violence is your religion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a <u>multitude</u> of custom-coded SuperVillains. All inspired by your favorite superheroes, all with unique abilities and powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absolutely <u>dominate</u>\u00a0the city of Godvale, killing anything and everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Supervillain has their own unique set of godlike powers: from 'Laser Vision' to Dark Magick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teleportation, Nanoblades, Mechsuit Technology, and nearly a dozen more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the god of your choice, you will take over this world and torment its population as you see fit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, <u>you</u> are the only one in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*************************************************************************</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in Procedural Dismemberment algorithm allows you laser ANY npc to pieces, in an ultra-realistic way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hear them scream, watch them die with their lasered-off limbs strewn about. They do not stand a chance against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Evil Superhero Simulator' is a huge passion project of mine.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am currently in game development school, and coding the mechanics in this Superhero game have been invaluable. I have wanted to release an epic Superhero simulator for years!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy! More content is being coded right now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Luke</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Superhero Central"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/6c0b4967b67a6f330b9545d0dfeaec3d9787f705/header.jpg?t=1754866523","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https