e855/ss_e127810284b1f7f49171a37523d067f61747e855.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754866523","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863710/e127810284b1f7f49171a37523d067f61747e855/ss_e127810284b1f7f49171a37523d067f61747e855.600x338.jpg?t=1754866523"}],"short_description":"You are a god. The only man in the sky. People are your toys. Violence is your religion. Choose from a multitude of SuperVillains, all inspired by your favorite Superheroes. Kill THOUSANDS of NPCs. A supervillain sandbox with endless possibilities.","steam_appid":3863710,"support_info":{"email":"haroldcrowyt@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}